The Prince Taishi's roar of fury echoed from behind, but Chen Ji no longer cared. He led Chen Nian, step by step, toward the depths of the Dragon Vein core.

There, secrets sealed for ten thousand years awaited unveiling;

There, the truth of the Eye of Heavenly Dao was about to surface;

There, the fate of the Chen siblings would encounter its most critical turning point.

Yet at this moment, they did not know that deep within the seal of the Eye of Heavenly Dao, a pair of eyes transcending time and space were slowly opening—it had waited far too long.
